Description: panvk/jm: support queue global priorities through JM contexts
 Create a panfrost JM context with the requested priority for LOW and HIGH
 queues and submit through it. Advertise the global priority extensions
 on JM only when the kernel reports the low context priority as allowed.
Author: pocket-debs
Origin: https://github.com/masterxq/mesa-lisbon (branch lisbon/26.3)
Forwarded: no
License: MIT (as the patched files)
Last-Update: 2026-11-25
